stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> REQUESTED : Customer places order

    REQUESTED --> ACCEPTED : System validates customer info & addresses
    REQUESTED --> CANCELLED : Customer cancels order

    ACCEPTED --> SCHEDULED : Order passes initial zone check & enters queue
    ACCEPTED --> CANCELLED : Customer cancels order

    SCHEDULED --> ASSIGNED : Eligible drone locked (Proximity-first, 20% reserve)
    SCHEDULED --> RESCHEDULING_REQUIRED : Zone restriction active / no drone eligible
    SCHEDULED --> CANCELLED : Customer cancels order

    ASSIGNED --> IN_TRANSIT : Pre-flight diagnostics pass, drone departs
    ASSIGNED --> SCHEDULED : Reassigned before flight (drone hot-swap)
    ASSIGNED --> CANCELLED : Customer cancels (pre-transit lockout applies after this)

    IN_TRANSIT --> DELIVERED : Package successfully released at destination
    IN_TRANSIT --> RESCHEDULING_REQUIRED : In-flight exception (RTB safely to recovery station)
    IN_TRANSIT --> FAILED : Catastrophic failure / irreparable loss

    RESCHEDULING_REQUIRED --> SCHEDULED : Rescheduled with new time/route/drone
    RESCHEDULING_REQUIRED --> CANCELLED : Customer cancels order
    RESCHEDULING_REQUIRED --> FAILED : Rescheduling retry limit exceeded

    DELIVERED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
